# What the disc carries as text, with the same line endings on every checkout: a Windows clone
# would otherwise get the scripts, Config.ini and the project file with CRLF, and build a disc
# whose files differ from the release's.
*.lua text eol=lf
*.ini text eol=lf
*.octp text eol=lf
# Raw palette bytes inside its strings: kept exactly as they are.
proj/Scripts/PipePalettes.lua -text
